ListenAddress 10.10.0.9:22
HostKey /etc/ssh/response/host_key
PidFile /run/sshd-response.pid

KexAlgorithms ecdh-sha2-nistp384
HostKeyAlgorithms ecdsa-sha2-nistp384
PubkeyAcceptedAlgorithms ecdsa-sha2-nistp384
Ciphers aes256-gcm@openssh.com
MACs hmac-sha2-512-etm@openssh.com,hmac-sha2-512

AllowUsers root@10.10.30.10
PermitRootLogin forced-commands-only
AuthenticationMethods publickey
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
AuthorizedKeysFile /etc/ssh/response/authorized_keys
StrictModes yes
ForceCommand /bin/sh /etc/response/fw-response

PermitTTY no
AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
PermitTunnel no
PermitUserEnvironment no
GatewayPorts no
UseDNS no

MaxAuthTries 2
MaxSessions 2
MaxStartups 3:50:6
LoginGraceTime 10
ClientAliveInterval 10
ClientAliveCountMax 3
PerSourcePenaltyExemptList 10.10.30.10

SyslogFacility AUTH
LogLevel VERBOSE
